1a:["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"每条交互先转为包含描述、关键词和标签的笔记，并生成向量表示。系统检索有关旧 memory，由 model 判断链接、调整旧笔记属性；回答时从更新后的 memory 网络取回相关内容，作为 reasoning context。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A-MEM: Agentic Memory for LLM Agents · v11","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"沿用多 Session 对话记忆场景作教学演示：旧 Note 记录 Alex 计划跑马拉松，新对话说 Alex 因膝伤改做游泳。系统生成内容、时间、Keywords、Tags、Context Description 和 Embedding，检索相关旧 Note，由 LLM 决定建立关系并更新语境。之后查询训练计划时，检索能接触到相互关联的信息。具体人物与事件为构造示例。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A-MEM: Agentic Memory for LLM Agents · v11","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]
1b:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Note 可看作包含原始内容 c、时间 t、关键词 K、标签 G、语境 X、Embedding e 与链接 L 的记录。检索先按 Embedding 相似度缩小范围，再由语言判断决定关系。这里的图边表示系统推断的关联，并不是统计意义上已经证实的因果关系；生成 Note 的操作也没有保证事实无损的定理。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"mᵢ = {cᵢ, tᵢ, Kᵢ, Gᵢ, Xᵢ, eᵢ, Lᵢ}\nNew interaction → Note → candidate neighbors → links / revisions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A-MEM: Agentic Memory for LLM Agents · v11","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：动态组织与更新是否改善记忆问答？→ Experiment：在长期对话 Benchmark、多个 Foundation Models 上比较记忆基线，并消融链接和演化组件。→ Answer：作者报告任务收益；这支持结构化 Memory 的价值，不能单凭问答分数证明所有自动生成的链接都准确。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A-MEM: Agentic Memory for LLM Agents · v11","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"作者在 LoCoMo 与 DialSim 长期对话任务中报告改善，并在多种 foundation model 上比较 memory 方法。第 4.3 节同时呈现不同任务的表现和 ablation，因此应理解为这些 memory 问答设置中的增益，而非通用能力倍增。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A-MEM: Agentic Memory for LLM Agents · v11","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A-MEM 把 Memory 从静态仓库变成可修订的数据结构。评价时需要同时看答案、检索证据和记忆改动，否则无法知道收益来自真正组织改善还是更多上下文被提供给 Model。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A-MEM: Agentic Memory for LLM Agents · v11","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
